al order data (60 records). The model achieved and MAE of 38 orders and R^2  OF 0.68, performing well on typical days but underestimating high demand spikes, likely due to the small data set. Overall, the prject shows that simple order data can produce a reasonably predictive model, and demonstrates the full data science workflow from cleaning to evaluation."],"metadata":{"id":"KbL85OO1U--Q"}}]}